# Ignoring polarisation overestimates the index of a high-contrast strip.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy.
title Silicon strip 1000 x 220 nm, scalar field
grid dx=0.025 dy=0.02
window width=3.0 ymin=-1.0 ymax=1.22
rect si -0.5 0.5 0 0.22
symmetry even
field scalar
expect neff 2.775420060 2e-8
expect group_index 3.789256819 2e-6
expect confinement 0.805316599 1e-6
expect area 0.236896129 1e-5
expect guided yes
expect cells 6660
